  su name read tool do ob text "be read from filename <path> ... : extract text from docs/audio/image via read auto" ya
  su name see tool do ob text "be see from filename <image> ... : ask a vision-capable mind directly" ya
  su name command tool do ob text "be command ... : inspect/process files" ya
  su name repair tool do ob text "be repair ... : patch code/text files safely" ya
